ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF2n6cwQk4QhhVPNBvrUWhtU3OYVJBJnXGB38TeI4foKw&oe=6A7D9B41"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot05.png", "id": "1261876702076399", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307935_1261876705409732_7745307008139158794_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fdfbp2tWPmIQ7kNvwE28MWF&_nc_oc=Ado_nQzlpzuXgTrbBKFD4b0fUdlosDBujDkYBEkLdmDDFC-nOvoIO6yDJLhlmRt1yPg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGUKuDQ0B53dwm0RCdsWhQHCh0_6dhLcUJ9kpF7xkZhDA&oe=6A7DB15B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Battle Edge", "keywords": ["battle", "battlegrounds", "sword", "pvp", "weapon"], "long_description": "**No dull duel survives!**\n\nWelcome to Battle Edge \u2014 a free multiplayer brawler set on alien battlegrounds where physics-fueled chaos reigns. Focusing on the battle, 1v1, 2v2 and more are coming. Just pure, player-driven combat in the name of the Edge.\n\nExplore the alien planets freely. Whether you take a strike or fool around, the battlefield feeds on your every move.\n{1989007958301067}\n\ud83d\udca3 **Unleash Chaos: Gears & Buffs**\n\nExperience classic throwing weapons or handheld **wands**, all will make your battles exciting and varied. Equip blades, **flying axes**, **boxing** gloves, **slow trap bombs**, or toxic mist grenades \u2014 bend the battlefield to your style. Power up with burgers, stack rare buffs, and swing special claws for savage combos.\n\n\u2694\ufe0f **Physics PvP: Smash & Outplay**\n\nEngage in pure physics-powered PvP chaos. Throw enemies off ledges, clash blades mid-air, or strike from hidden angles. Every swing, collision, and dodge is real \u2014 no two fights are ever the same.\n{1873574003484003}\n\ud83c\udf00 **Unreal Mobility**\n\nTraverse alien ruins however you want. Grapple walls, swing like a spiderman, or activate jump pads and teleporters to break through any line of defense. Master verticality and surprise!\n{1105452988106040}\n**Forge Your Edge!**\n\nShape your look, gear up, and stand out on the battlefield.\n\nMissions: Take quests, light up the **Talent Tree** & earn loot.\n\n\ud83d\udc49 **Add to your Wishlist , Join our test and claim rewards**: https://discord.gg/nN6K4FQYXt\n", "short_description": "No dull duel survives!\nWelcome to Battle Edge \u2014 a free multiplayer brawler set on alien battlegrounds where physics-fueled chaos reigns. Focusing on the battle, 1v1, 2v2 and more are coming. Just pure, player-driven combat in the name of the Edge. Join Discord Here: Welcome to Battle Edge \u2014 a free multiplayer brawler set on alien battlegrounds where physics-fueled chaos reigns. Focusing on the battle, 1v1, 2v2 and more are coming. Just pure, player-driven combat in the name of the Edge."}]}, "developer_name": "Suplife Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vrsuplife.com/privacyPolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Suplife Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://linktr.ee/suplife_vr", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "23951560497834550"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "752548550572156"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "752548550572156"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 17660808